                  <story-point caption='Attrition is a Significant Workforce Challenge - 1 in every 6 employees is leaving the organization' captured-sheet='' id='2' />
                  <story-point caption='Sales Department Faces the Highest Attrition - More than half of all attrition comes from Sales' captured-sheet='Department wise Attrition' id='3' />
                  <story-point caption='Young and Mid-Career Employees are Leaving Most Frequently - Employees aged 25–34 account for the highest attrition' captured-sheet='Attrition Rate Gender for Different Age Group' id='5' />
                  <story-point caption='Gender Gap in Attrition Requires Attention - Male employees leave more frequently than female employees' captured-sheet='Attrition Rate Gender for Different Age Group' id='6' />
                  <story-point caption='Attrition Concentrated Among Specific Education Fields - Life Sciences and Medical backgrounds show the highest turnover' captured-sheet='Education Field wise Attrition' id='10' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='41598' hidden='true' id='6' story-point-id='2' type-v2='text' w='97441' x='787' y='15664'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Insights:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Total employees: </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>1,470</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Attrition count: </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>237</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Attrition rate: </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>16.12%</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Active employees: </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>1,233</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Business Impact:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
A 16% attrition rate suggests the organization is losing talent at a notable pace, increasing recruitment and training costs while impacting productivity.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Recommendation:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
Conduct exit interviews and identify key drivers behind employee turnover.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='52593' hidden='true' id='7' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='30906' x='68307' y='29564'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Business Impact:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
Sales contributes the largest share of employee exits, indicating possible issues related to workload, incentives, performance pressure, or career growth opportunities.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Recommendation:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
Review compensation structures, career progression, and employee engagement initiatives within the Sales function. </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='25311' hidden='true' id='8' story-point-id='5' type-v2='text' w='68110' x='787' y='15664'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Business Impact:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
The company is losing employees during their most productive and growth-oriented career phase.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Recommendation:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
Focus on retention programs, skill development, mentorship, and career advancement opportunities for employees between 25–34 years. </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='30498' id='9' story-point-id='6' type-v2='text' w='79331' x='787' y='15664'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Business Impact:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
The attrition trend is more pronounced among male employees, particularly in the 25–34 age segment.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Recommendation:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
Investigate department-specific causes and engagement levels among male employees to identify targeted retention strategies.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{C34CAD0E-7507-463F-BFA0-61DB96BB93DA}' />
    </dashboard>
